It is quarter to three and we are about to get in the car to go to the airport

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.000
It's nice sunny weather in Stockholm

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
I don't know what to think about this.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
I'm getting the feeling that our car might be covered in snow 

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
It may take a while to find our car

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Keep left then take the exit left

